\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces  Illustration of the Eulerian Implicit, Lagrangian Explicit cell integrated semi-Lagrangian (CISL) method\cite  {jemison2014compressible,scardovelli2003interface}. Rather than have separate traversals through the grid for the cell-centered, face centered, and edge centered variables, we instead interpolate all variables to a refined grid, followed by one traversal through the refined grid, and then conservatively average the respective results back to their defined control volumes. }}{14}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{EILE}{{1}{14}{Illustration of the Eulerian Implicit, Lagrangian Explicit cell integrated semi-Lagrangian (CISL) method\cite {jemison2014compressible,scardovelli2003interface}. Rather than have separate traversals through the grid for the cell-centered, face centered, and edge centered variables, we instead interpolate all variables to a refined grid, followed by one traversal through the refined grid, and then conservatively average the respective results back to their defined control volumes}{figure.1}{}}
